@startuml VirtualRacingSequence
actor User
participant "VirtualRacingController" as API
participant "VirtualRacingService" as Service
participant "IVirtualRaceRepository" as RaceRepo
participant "IHorseRepository" as HorseRepo

== Endpoint: Pobieranie aktywnych wyścigów ==
User -> API : GET /api/virtual-racing/active
API -> Service : GetActiveRacesAsync()
Service -> RaceRepo : GetActiveRacesAsync()
RaceRepo --> Service : List<VirtualRace>
Service --> API : List<VirtualRaceDto>
API --> User : 200 OK (JSON)

== Generowanie wyścigu (np. przez Background Worker / Admina) ==
actor System
System -> Service : GenerateRaceAsync()
Service -> HorseRepo : GetAllAsync()
HorseRepo --> Service : List<Horse>
Service -> Service : Losowanie uczestników i kursów
Service -> RaceRepo : AddAsync(newRace)
RaceRepo --> Service : Task Completed
Service --> System : VirtualRace

== Symulacja wyścigu (Rozstrzygnięcie) ==
System -> Service : SimulateRaceAsync(raceId)
Service -> RaceRepo : GetByIdAsync(raceId)
RaceRepo --> Service : VirtualRace
Service -> Service : Obliczenie zwycięskiego konia (ML/Random)
Service -> RaceRepo : UpdateAsync(race)
RaceRepo --> Service : Task Completed
Service --> System : WinningHorseId
@enduml